  "description": "\n  \n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOrigin Lab Game Recordings v0.4.0\n\t\n\nOrigin Lab Game Recordings v0.4.0 is a multi-modal video game dataset for training world models, e.g. action-conditioned video generation, depth and camera-pose estimation, and imitation learning from human play: 163 hours of human gameplay from 20 licensed games, recorded inside the game engine at 1080p and 60 FPS, with keyboard and mouse input, depth, surface normals, camera pose, in-engine events and audio on one shared frame clock.… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/originlab/game-recordings-v4.",
